<title>USA: NYSE closing averages.</title>
<headline>NYSE closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the New York Stock Exchange closed higher in heavy trading Tuesday.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones Industrial Average rose 50.69 to 6397.60, a record.</p>
<p>The NYSE Composite rose 1.90 to 391.80, a record.</p>
<p>The average price per share rose $0.20.</p>
<p>Gainers beat losers 1435 to 1008.</p>
<p>Volume was 454,412,759, compared with 388,044,050 Monday.</p>
